  "conclusion": [
    "Money-loss events use main:L3003 and store the reduced value back through main:L3054; the displayed amount is the loss, not the remaining money.",
    "Money-gain events use main:L305A and add $5F..$61 to player money through main:L3045.",
    "With $CA55 = 0, zb and zv skip their full-rules reserve branches.",
    "zt, zw, and zx are one-shot per player through bits $01, $02, and $08 in $CA61 + player.",
